BaseConfigLib::initializeExpiry
├── given zero values
│   └── it should store zero packed value
├── given only min value
│   └── it should store min in lower bits
├── given only max value
│   └── it should store max in upper bits
├── given both min and max
│   ├── it should store packed value correctly
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
└── given extra data after expiry
    └── it should return extra data as remaining